	<TextRow
		Label="msg_h06_fighterm_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>うみの　なかって　こうなのか！▼
およげないから　みることは　ない▼
そう　あきらめてたから　かんどうだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-17T07:09:19" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T09:20:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>海中って　こうなのか！▼
泳げないから　みることは　ない▼
そう　あきらめてたから　感動だ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-17T07:09:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T09:23:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・t04側</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T09:21:43" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>FIGHTERM</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T09:20:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T07:44:57" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_h06_man3_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あるく　すいぞくかん　っていうけど
これって　ポケモンたちが▽
ぼくらを　みてるんじゃないの？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T09:06:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T09:06:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>歩く　水族館　っていうけど
これって　ポケモンたちが▽
ぼくらを　みてるんじゃないの？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T09:08:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T09:07:02" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・c14側</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T09:09:57" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MAN3</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T09:07:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T07:44:57" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_h06_soccerm_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>うわー！
かいこうだ！▼
ふかいなー！
１まんメートルとか　あるのかな？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T08:42:41" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T08:40:53" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>うわー！
海溝だ！▼
深いなー！
１万メートルとか　あるのかな？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T08:43:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T08:43:02" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・下記動作モデルに隣接
・橋の中間部、海溝辺り</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T08:42:03" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SOCCERM</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T09:19:54" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T07:44:57" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_h06_maid_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そうよ……　ふかいのよ……
あいは……　どこまでも……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T08:42:56" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T08:41:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そうよ……　深いのよ……
愛は……　どこまでも……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T08:43:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T08:41:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・上記動作モデルに隣接
・橋の中間部、海溝辺り</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T08:42:05" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MAID</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T09:19:36" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T07:44:57" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_h06_lady_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>さて　あまごい　ですが
これは　もう　せつなる　おもいを▽
こめて　つかう　わざ　です▼
つかいどころ　としては……▼
ダメね……　あたしったら！
グッとくる　アイデアが　うかばないわ▼
これでは　テレビで
うまく　せつめい　できないわね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-09T02:20:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T09:11:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>さて　あまごい　ですが
これは　もう　切なる　想いを▽
こめて　使う　技　です▼
使いどころ　としては……▼
ダメね……　あたしったら！
グッとくる　アイデアが　浮かばないわ▼
これでは　テレビで
うまく　説明できないわね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-09T02:20:31" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T09:11:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・テレビに登場するワザマ・シン先生</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T08:58:56" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>LADY</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T09:01:58" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T07:44:57" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
